to is excellent and it is possible to see traces of almost the entire text, as originally read by Gabrici. \u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1926-1927 04.0043 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kretschmer 1927 307 no.4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002533\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002533\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Gabrici 1929 55-56 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001976\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001976\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bisi 1970 101 no.5 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002148\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002148\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manni Piraino 1973 23 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1992 42.1845 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2000 50.0993 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Vento 2000 88-91 tav.53-55 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001525\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001525\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> \u003Cp>Simple letters with slight serfis to the strokes, particularly to the top of the alpha. Alpha is broad with straight bar. The initial theta appears circular with a central point; the final theta has a detached horizontal bar and is slightly ovoid.\u003C/p> Line 1    Interlineation lin